# Normalise to LF inside the repository. Matters for the Makefile: make on Linux
# and macOS chokes on CRLF recipe lines, and this file is edited on Windows.
* text=auto

# Visual Studio rewrites these with CRLF every time it touches them, so storing
# them that way keeps the diffs empty.
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf
